   <section className="market-section"><div className="section-heading"><div><div className="eyebrow"><span className="section-no">LIVE</span> MARKET RADAR</div><h2>What the chain is <span>talking about.</span></h2><p>Live DEX Screener trends and new Solana token profiles. Signals are descriptive, never a promise.</p></div><a className="text-link" href="https://dexscreener.com/solana" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open DEX Screener ↗</a></div><div className="market-grid">{themes.slice(0,4).map(m=><article className="market-card" key={m.slug}><div className="market-card-head"><span className="market-emoji">{m.icon?.value||'✦'}</span><div className="market-card-title"><b>{m.name}</b><small>{m.tokenCount||0} tracked tokens · 24h move {pct(m.marketCapChange?.h24)}</small></div><span className="live-pill">LIVE META</span></div><div className="market-metrics"><span>24H VOLUME<b>{usd(m.volume)}</b></span><span>LIQUIDITY<b>{usd(m.liquidity)}</b></span><span>MARKET CAP<b>{usd(m.marketCap)}</b></span></div><div className="market-foot"><span>{m.description||'Active Solana meta'}</span><a href="https://dexscreener.com/solana" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Source ↗</a></div></article>)}</div>{marketState==='error'&&<div className="inline-state">Live market data is temporarily unavailable. <button onClick={refresh}>Retry</button></div>}</section>
